# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in. Loaded by wrangler in local dev only.
# For production, set with: wrangler secret put MY_SECRET
# Bindings (D1, KV, R2, etc.) go in wrangler.jsonc, NOT here.

# Bearer token for the read-only /ext/v1/* API (consumed by the TAP
# miniapp dashboard). Leave unset to keep /ext/v1/* switched off — it
# fails closed with 503 rather than serving unauthenticated requests.
# Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 32
# ANALYTICS_API_TOKEN="..."
